  "description": "Gi-Hu, a high schooler with a passion for photographing the sky, dreams of entering a photography contest. However, the contest requires a portrait photo, which he’s terrible at. He enlists the help of Ha-neul, a mysterious new transfer student who accidentally appears in one of Gi-Hu’s sky photos. Despite his struggles, he finds himself wanting to take more photos of her. As they prepare for the school festival, Gi-Hu becomes more intrigued by Ha-Neul, while she, initially misjudging him, helps him out of guilt after realizing she underestimated his abilities. \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
